        },
        {
            "jpName": "スーパークリーク",
            "enName": "Super Creek",
            "jpText": "何か、体にいいものを差し入れして\nあげたいのだけれど……。",
            "enText": "If only I could give them something \nto help replenish their strength…",
            "nextBlock": 3,
